WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.444
ACE2 can be embedded in a cell membrane or exist in

00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:10.338
a soluble form. They should not be discussed as identical biological objects.

00:00:14.383 --> 00:00:20.280
ACE2 participates in the renin-angiotensin system. In SARS-CoV-2

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:26.178
infection, its receptor-related role introduces additional biological complexity.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:36.323
The review examines how changes in membrane-bound and soluble

00:00:36.323 --> 00:00:41.845
ACE2 expression might influence interpretations of viral biology and complications.

00:00:46.217 --> 00:00:50.271
A measured protein change does not, without suitable

00:00:50.271 --> 00:00:54.326
functional evidence, settle viral infectivity or clinical outcomes.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:02.752
The 2021 review weighs emerging research at a rapidly

00:01:02.752 --> 00:01:07.703
changing moment. The date of evidence matters for its interpretation.

00:01:11.675 --> 00:01:16.220
A careful mechanistic discussion starts by saying which ACE2

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.766
form, which tissue and which endpoint is actually being investigated.
